## Running it

Requires [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/). Python 3.13 is installed by uv itself.

```bash
uv sync                         # build the environment from uv.lock
cp .env.example .env            # then put your provider key in .env
```

**Regenerate the dataset** (optional -- the committed data is byte-identical):

```bash
uv run python -m generator.cli
# wrote 200 scenarios (seed 20250816) to data/erp and data/labels
```

**Start the mock ERP:**

```bash
uv run uvicorn mock_erp.app:app --reload --port 8000
curl -s localhost:8000/healthz
# {"vendors":12,"materials":40,"plants":4,"purchase_orders":200,...}
```

**Read a document the way the agent does:**

```bash
BASE=localhost:8000/sap/opu/odata/sap/ZPROC_SRV
curl -s "$BASE/A_SupplierInvoice('5100000901')"
curl -s "$BASE/A_PurchaseOrder('4500000009')"          # carries ToleranceConfig
curl -s "$BASE/A_MaterialDocumentItem?\$filter=PurchaseOrder%20eq%20'4500000009'"
```

**Run the agent on one invoice** (needs a provider key in `.env`):

```bash
uv run proc-agent --invoice 5100000901
uv run proc-agent --invoice 5100000901 --json    # machine-readable, for evals
```

Exit code is `0` if the agent submitted a resolution, `1` if it did not.

**Walk the approval gate by hand** -- the agent cannot do any of this:

```bash
# 1. the agent proposes (this is the only write it can make)
curl -s -X POST "$BASE/ProposeCorrection" -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{
  "invoice_number":"5100000901",
  "payload":{"correction_type":"AMEND_INVOICE_QUANTITY","invoice_number":"5100000901",
             "inv_item_number":"0001","from_quantity":"14.000","to_quantity":"13.000"},
  "agent_reasoning":"Receipts total 13.000 against 14.000 invoiced."}'

# 2. applying now is refused: 409 ILLEGAL_TRANSITION
# 3. a HUMAN approves, on a different router
curl -s -X POST localhost:8000/approval/proposals/PR-000001/approve \
  -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{"approved_by":"ap.supervisor@example.com"}'

# 4. apply -- payload must hash-match what was approved
# 5. re-read the invoice: MENGE is now 13.000, on the same URL as step 0
```

**Tests and lint:**

```bash
uv run pytest -q          # 157 passed
uv run ruff check .
```

